      "markdown": "**页面目的**：建立知识库模块目标。\n\n**中文屏幕文案**\n\n> # 当期材料回答“这周发生了什么”，知识库回答“长期按什么口径工作”  \n> 这一站，你会把稳定规范与本周记录分开，并用 LLM Wiki Skill 整理一套可检索知识。\n\n**English copy**\n\n> # Current records explain what happened this week; a knowledge base explains the stable rules  \n> Separate temporary task inputs from reusable knowledge, then organize trusted material with the LLM Wiki Skill.\n\n**主按钮**：开始整理知识 / Start organizing knowledge。\n\n---",
